note: A countdown that uses two libraries.
note: Run it with: imagine examples/clock.imagine

use: time
use: maths

genesis:
  scrawl "Hello, it is ", hour now, ":", two digits with minute now, "."
  for each n from 1 to 3:
    scrawl 4 minus n, "..."
    wait 1 second
  scrawl "Done! That took about ", round (seconds since start), " seconds."
and the universe said i love you

to two digits, given x (a number), giving back text:
  if x is less than 10: give back "0" plus x
  give back x as text
and the universe said i love you
